<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ DE TENERIFE, Spain 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries</p>
<p>in the Spanish league championship on Friday:</p>
<p> Tenerife   3 - &quot;Juanele&quot; Castano 7, Kodro 43,</p>
<p>		     Jokanovic 56 (pen)</p>
<p> Athletic Bilbao  3 - Urzaiz 43, Larrazabal 45 (pen),</p>
<p>			    Alkiza 74</p>
<p>    HT: 2-2     Attendance: 18,000.</p>
